.jpg", "year": "2017", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "邱赫南,侯佩杉,魏哲鸣,黄千硕,朱庭辰,贾司特,张珂源,曾丽瑶,张双利,刘玉翠,吴任远", "director": "李遥波", "content": "<p>《龙日一，你死定了》是一部校园、青春、时尚网剧。该剧主要讲述优等生张静美转校来到顶级精英学府——本承学院，却在入校第一天不幸遇到“校园魔头”龙日一。两人就在这一来一回、斗智斗勇的较量中互生情愫。他们的恋情在本承学院掀起巨大波澜，同时也让龙日一家族的关系变得微妙起来……</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202607/03/LUD6ffiwHU97/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/jUvd3VSyXc1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/83JtT5MB821/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/28/7HqDLhsXi51/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/vzrB4Pv14w1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/50nCDkmpQa1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/BqbKDQDDnW1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/6An1Ff7ZJ31/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/SemSJZnvGA1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/NtSXPyGUzU1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/28/L2fDCG4Cga1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v7.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv7/202309/12/mnnxtMzXAe1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/cLMasGMyAw1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/8KQSdETVE21/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第14集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/uqqF7DDVPa1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第15集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/Dth018sQnq1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第16集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/u3gcQMjnKC1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第17集",